refine your idea.

00:04:26.294 --> 00:04:29.638
[MUSIC]

00:04:29.638 --> 00:04:34.415
In order for ideas to be valuable, the
economics need to work.

00:04:34.415 --> 00:04:39.213
If it's a new product idea, you need to
build a viable business model, but

00:04:39.213 --> 00:04:44.950
your idea may involve changing and
internal processes within an organization.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:49.130
So you need to understand what are the
resources that you need to bring together,

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:52.340
and what is the case that you will need to
make to other people

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:54.500
to convince them to change that process.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.380
If we are working on a new product idea,

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.660
the first question is, what is the value
proposition?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.080
Write down the value proposition.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.315
The second one is, who's gonna be your
customer?

00:05:05.315 --> 00:05:07.468
Your customer segment.

00:05:07.468 --> 00:05:09.233
Define your customer segment.

00:05:09.233 --> 00:05:12.550
Third one is, how are you gonna reach
them?

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.480
And the fourth one is, how are you gonna
