00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:32.420
And when this becomes a full product, this
is the price that we're gonna charge.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.330
And people are gonna react.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:38.190
So, the fundament, the idea is there are
four

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:43.200
basic elements of the business model that
you need to prototype early.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:46.745
Value proposition, customer segment,
channel of how you're

00:06:46.745 --> 00:06:50.692
gonna find the customer, and revenue, how
you're gonna make money.

00:06:50.692 --> 00:06:54.914
Make sure that as you start prototyping
and testing your prototype,

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:59.861
you do that in a way that is consistent
with those elements of the business model,

00:06:59.861 --> 00:07:03.100
